*** Contexts of data through CMF ***
data-contexts-unserialized.ket:SUCCEED
data-contexts-without-context-unserialized.ket:SUCCEED
data-contexts-without-context written again unchanged: True
rejected-cmf-context-after-generic-sgroup: CMF loader: a data S-group context that follows no data S-group
rejected-cmf-context-before-any-sgroup: CMF loader: a data S-group context that follows no data S-group
*** KET 2.0 keys with values outside the contract ***
rejected-context-lowercase: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'context' "fragment", which is not a valid context
rejected-context-not-string: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'context' 5, which is not a string
rejected-field-name-not-string: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'fieldName' 5, which is not a string
rejected-placement-not-boolean: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'placement' 1, which is not a boolean
rejected-tag-two-characters: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'tag' "ab", which is not a single character
rejected-x-four-decimals-lost: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'x' 1234.5678, which cannot be kept to four decimals
rejected-x-not-number: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'x' "1.5", which is not a number
*** Values KET keeps and a molfile does not allow ***
molfile-refuses-coordinate, V2000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: '-10000.0000' is not a valid coordinate of the value
molfile-refuses-coordinate, V3000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: '-10000.0000' is not a valid coordinate of the value
molfile-refuses-displayed-chars, V2000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: '1000' is not a valid number of characters to display
molfile-refuses-displayed-chars, V3000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: '1000' is not a valid number of characters to display
molfile-refuses-query-operator, V2000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: 'query,;:|{}$op' is not a valid query operator
molfile-refuses-query-operator, V3000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: 'query,;:|{}$op' is not a valid query operator
molfile-refuses-query-type, V2000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: 'Q' is not a valid query type
molfile-refuses-query-type, V3000: molfile saver: data S-group 1: 'Q' is not a valid query type
